      "pinyin": "tā piàn tā bà ba shuō jīn tiān wǒ bú yòng qù xué xiào jīn tiān méi yǒu kè",
      "english": "Little Ming didn't want to go to school."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "He tricked his father by saying: “I don't have to go to school, there's no class today.”"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "小明的爸爸说：“那我们去看电影吧！”",
      "traditional": "小明的爸爸說：“那我們去看電影吧！”",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng de bà ba shuō nà wǒ men qù kàn diàn yǐng ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming's father said: “Then let's go watch a movie!”"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "小明很开心地上车了，心想：",
      "traditional": "小明很開心地上車了，心想：",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng hěn kāi xīn de shàng chē le xīn xiǎng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "真好。不用上学，还可以看电影。",
      "traditional": "真好。不用上學，還可以看電影。",
      "pinyin": "zhēn hǎo bú yòng shàng xué hái kě yǐ kàn diàn yǐng",
      "english": "Little Ming happily got in the car and thought to himself:"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Great. I don't have to go to school, and I can see a movie too."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "不久，爸爸说：“到了，下车吧！”",
      "traditional": "不久，爸爸說：“到了，下車吧！”",
      "pinyin": "bù jiǔ bà ba shuō dào le xià chē ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Before long, his father said: “We're here, get off!”"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "小明下车一看，这哪是电影院呀，这是校门口。",
      "traditional": "小明下車一看，這哪是電影院呀，這是校門口。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng xià chē yí kàn zhè nǎ shì diàn yǐng yuàn ya zhè shì xiào mén kǒu",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming got out of the car and took a look. This isn't the movie theatre, it's the school entrance."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "小明回头看着爸爸，",
      "traditional": "小明回頭看著爸爸，",
